            <div xml:id="d271">

                <pb facs="0278" n="270" sameAs="frus:frus1937v04/pg270"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/9549: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Japan</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Grew</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-08-21T10:00:00+09:00">August 21, 1937—10
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received August 21—9:40 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>290. 1. An official of the Foreign Office called under instructions this morning
                    at the Embassy to express regret over the casualties <pb facs="0279" n="271"
                        xml:id="pg271"/> incurred by members of the crew of the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Augusta</hi> now at Shanghai. The official stated that
                    the Foreign Office had received no official report from Shanghai but that
                    according to press reports the casualties were caused by a shell fired by the
                    Chinese: that the Foreign Office is mindful, however, that the incident would
                    not have arisen had there been no hostilities between the Japanese and Chinese
                    forces: and that the Foreign Office desires to express its sincere regrets for
                    the loss of life and the injury incurred by members of the American Navy.</p>
                <p>2. We informed the official that we appreciate the action of the Foreign Office
                    in instructing the official to call, and that the Department would be duly
                    informed.</p>
                <p>3. Repeated to Shanghai for relay to Nanking.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Grew</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
